# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated outputs
#
# Committed on purpose: metrics, subgroup tables, error samples, and figures —
# they are the evidence behind the results table in the README.
# Excluded: full prediction dumps (verbatim dataset text) and run logs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
outputs/**/predictions.csv
outputs/**/*.log
outputs/**/*smoke*
MPLCONFIGDIR/

# Per-fold diagnostic plots from the generator-holdout sweeps: 12 folds x 8
# figures that nothing references. The summary figure and every per-fold metric
# are kept.
outputs/figures/*/generator_holdout/
outputs/figures/*/generator_holdout_control/

